l status of patients, especially those with chronic liver disease, can impact the outcomes of liver transplantation.\n\nAdditionally, while liver transplantation was evaluated as a treatment option for the patient with MNGIE, it was ultimately deemed unsuitable. Overall, liver transplantation is a critical surgical intervention for patients suffering from severe liver conditions, providing a potential cure and significantly improving quality of life.", "NUTRICIÓN RIESGO SCREENING 2002:NRS-2002 is a tool used to assess nutritional risk in patients.", "SONDA NASOYEYUNAL:SONDA NASOYEYUNAL refers to a medical device known as a nasojejunal tube, which is specifically designed for enteral feeding. This tube is inserted through the nose and extends into the jejunum, a part of the small intestine. It is utilized for nutritional support in patients who are unable to eat normally due to specific gastrointestinal conditions or when the stomach is not functioning properly. The primary purpose of the Sonda Nasoyeyunal is to provide enteral nutrition to individuals who require assistance with feeding, ensuring they receive the necessary nutrients when oral intake is not feasible.", "HEPARINA DE BAJO PESO MOLECULAR:Heparina de bajo peso molecular is a type of anticoagulant used to prevent blood clots.", "PLIEGUE TRICIPITAL:The \"Pliegue Tricipital\" is a measurement utilized to estimate body fat in the body by assessing the thickness of skinfolds, specifically taken from the non-dominant arm. This measurement serves as an important tool for evaluating body fat percentage, which in turn offers valuable insights into an individual's nutritional status.", "PERÍMETRO MUSCULAR DEL BRAZO:The \"Perímetro Muscular del Brazo\" is a measurement that estimates lean body mass by utilizing the Circunferencia Braquial (brachial circumference) and the Pliegue Tricipital (triceps skinfold). This calculation serves as an important tool for assessing muscle mass, providing valuable insights into an individual's body composition.", "M. ARGENTE PLA:M. Argente Pla is a medical doctor and a prominent contributor to various chapters related to nutrition in medical contexts. He has authored and co-authored several significant works, including a chapter on nutrition and diabetes in relation to cystic fibrosis, and has collaborated with M.D. Higón Ballester on this topic. Additionally, M. Argente Pla has written a chapter on artificial nutrition in acute pancreatitis and has contributed to discussions on artificial nutrition in liver diseases. His expertise extends to inflammatory bowel disease, where he has co-authored research on nutrition. \n\nM. Argente Pla is also involved in educational initiatives, having contributed to chapters on enteral nutrition, parenteral nutrition, nutritional requirements, and nutritional screening in hospitals. Furthermore, he has played a role in the nutritional assessment chapter, showcasing his comprehensive involvement in the field of nutrition within medical literature.", "K. GARCÍA MALPARTIDA:K. García Malpartida is a notable author who has made significant contributions to various chapters in a comprehensive document focused on nutrition. Specifically, K. García Malpartida is associated with the chapter on enteral nutrition, where they discuss its concepts and applications. Additionally, they are involved in the chapter on parenteral nutrition, addressing complications related to this form of nutrition. K. García Malpartida also contributes to the chapter on nutrition and diabetes within the context of cystic fibrosis, as well as the chapter detailing nutritional requirements in a medical context. Furthermore, they play a role in the educational material concerning nutritional screening in hospitals and are involved in the chapter on nutritional assessment. Overall, K. García Malpartida's work encompasses a wide range of topics related to nutrition, highlighting their expertise and commitment to the field.", "B. LEON DE ZAYAS:B. Leon de Zayas is one of the authors contributing to the educational material on nutritional screening in hospitals.", "J. F. MERINO TORRES:J. F. Merino Torres is one of the authors contributing to the educational material on nutritional screening in hospitals.", "SOCIETY EUROPEA PARA LA NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL Y PARENTERAL:The Society European for Enteral and Parenteral Nutrition (ESPEN) is an organization that provides guidelines and recommendations for nutritional practices in healthcare settings.", "SOCIETY AMERICANA PARA LA NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL Y PARENTERAL:The American Society for Enteral and Parenteral Nutrition (ASPEN) is an organization that offers guidelines for nutritional assessment and support in clinical settings.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO Y POLITÉCNICO LA FE:The Hospital Universitario y Politécnico La Fe is located in Valencia and is notable for its comprehensive healthcare services. Dr. Juan Francisco Merino Torres serves as the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at this hospital, where he is responsible for overseeing the department's operations. The hospital is dedicated to improving the nutritional status of both inpatients and outpatients, ensuring that patients receive the necessary support for their dietary needs. Additionally, the Hospital Universitario y Politécnico La Fe features a human milk bank, which provides essential resources for premature infants who require specialized nutritional support.", "COMISIÓN DE NUTRICIÓN HOSPITALARIA:A committee within the hospital focused on nutritional issues and guidelines for patient care.", "MARASMO:Marasmo is a type of severe malnutrition characterized by insufficient caloric intake, which results in a specific clinical presentation. It is primarily caused by a deficiency of both calories and protein, leading to significant weight loss and muscle wasting. This condition reflects a critical state of undernutrition, where the body does not receive the necessary nutrients to maintain normal physiological functions."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}